## CatalogItemsApi

### Get catalogs items (POST)
## Get catalogs items (POST)
POST https://api.pinterest.com/v5/catalogs/items?adAccountId={{adAccountId}}
Content-Type: application/json
Accept: application/json

{
 "country": "<string>",
 "filters": "<string>",
 "language": "<string>"
}


### Get item batch status
## Get item batch status
GET https://api.pinterest.com/v5/catalogs/items/batch/{{batch_id}}?adAccountId={{adAccountId}}
Accept: application/json

### Operate on item batch
## Operate on item batch
POST https://api.pinterest.com/v5/catalogs/items/batch?adAccountId={{adAccountId}}
Content-Type: application/json
Accept: application/json

{
 
}

